# AutoLoc API

AutoLoc is a car rental management REST API built with **Spring Boot**, **Maven**, **Spring Data JPA** and **MySQL**.
It models the core domain of a rental agency: agencies, employees, vehicles, equipment, maintenance, clients, reservations, contracts and payments.

Academic project, ESPRIT, UP ASI (Architecture des Systèmes d'Information), Atelier 1 and 2.

## Tech stack

| Technology | Version / usage |
|---|---|
| Java | 17 |
| Spring Boot | 4.1.1 |
| Spring Data JPA / Hibernate | Hibernate 7.4.5 |
| Spring Web MVC | REST layer (Tomcat, port 9090) |
| MySQL | MySQL Connector/J 9.7.0 |
| Lombok | `@Getter`, `@Setter`, `@NoArgsConstructor`, `@AllArgsConstructor` |
| Build tool | Maven |

